nd draft research publications in top neuroscience journals, in collaboration with other lab members.  Attend a weekly lab meeting and journal club and present data and/or papers as necessary. Key Competencies and Requirements: Bachelor’s degree (for Research Assistant) and Master’s degree (for Research Associate) in life science, neuroscience, computational biology, psychology, or relevant fields. We also invite candidates with interdisciplinary backgrounds to apply. Demonstrated experience in stereotaxic surgery and neural recording experiments in murine models is highly advantageous. Experience analyzing large-scale neural datasets, such as imaging, electrophysiology, or behavioral video data, is preferred but not required.  Competent in information visualization. A working knowledge of Adobe Illustrator is a strong advantage . Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a multidisciplinary environment. Entry level candidates are welcome to apply. We regret to inform that only shortlisted candidates will be notified. Hiring Institution: LKC"
