      "description": "Start date: 2025-06-17\nPosted: Posted 30+ Days Ago\nPart time\n\nNTU invites applications for part-time teaching of the language electives at the beginner and intermediate levels. Requirements: Master’s degree in Tamil Language or equivalent. A native speaker or a speaker with high proficiency of the Tamil Language Effectively bilingual in both Tamil and English Language. Experience in curriculum design and management. Knowledge in the application of IT in language teaching and experience with multimedia course materials At least 3 years of teaching experience, preferably in higher education. Only shortlisted candidates will be notified Hiring Institution: NTU"
