    "https://ntu.wd3.myworkdayjobs.com/Careers/job/NTU-Main-Campus-Singapore/Adjunct-Associate-Professor--NBS-_R00021022": {
      "title": "Adjunct Associate Professor (NBS)",
      "description": "Start date: 2025-06-12\nPosted: Posted 30+ Days Ago\nFull time\n\nThe  Nanyang Business School, Nanyang Technological University  invites applications for an Adjunct Associate Professor position under the Graduate Studies Office. The duties assigned are subjected to mutual agreement between the Adjunct and the Associate Dean (Graduate Studies) which may include the following:   To teach in Masters of Science in Business Analytics Be a guest speaker for workshops and seminars. Hiring Institution: NTU"
