    "https://ntu.wd3.myworkdayjobs.com/Careers/job/NTU-Main-Campus-Singapore/Project-Officer--Chemist-Material-Engineer-_R00012230-1": {
      "title": "Project Officer (Chemist/Material Engineer)",
      "description": "Start date: 2023-01-05\nPosted: Posted 30+ Days Ago\nFull time\n\nThe School of Mechanical & Aerospace Engineering (MAE) invites applications for the position of Project Officer.  Key Responsibilities:  Develop electrochemical processes (electroless plating, electroplating, electrochemical etching) Technical write up and presentation. Job Requirements:  Degree in Chemistry, Material Science and Engineering, or relative field Experience in surface finishing Knowledge and experience in electrochemistry A team player and technically motivated to solve problems. Good interpersonal and communication skills. This role will be exposed to Lead (inorganic and organic, as Pb)  & Mercury* (elemental & compound) in the course of work.   We regret that only shortlisted candidates will be notified. Hiring Institution: NTU"
