      "description": "Start date: 2026-10-07\nPosted: Posted 2 Days Ago\nPart time\n\nNational Institute of Education - Part-time Lecturers (ALC) The National Institute of Education (NIE) invites applications for the position of Part-time Lecturer in the Asian Languages & Cultures (ALC) Department. Job Description Part-Time Lecturers are engaged for teaching duties such as conducting lectures, tutorials and practicum supervision. Please refer to https://www.ntu.edu.sg/nie/ for more information on NIE courses/programmes. Requirements   A Master’s degree. Experience in teaching NIE courses/programmes.    Candidates who do not possess the above qualifications but have proven skills/industry experience are also invited to apply.  Other Information Part-time Lecturers will be paid on an hourly basis at the rates prescribed for the various courses/programmes. The engagement will be on a semester basis (January to June, July to December).   We regret that only shortlisted candidates will be notified.  Hiring Institution: NIE"
